  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Narration names Shadow Sect’s base as Life and death blessed land. That land contained the Door of Life and Death, and in front of this door there was a dream realm. Old Man Yan Shi enters that dream realm before the door while holding nine rank eight Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        984
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "loc_door_of_life_and_death",
        "char_old_man_yan_shi",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Life and death blessed land, after Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s dream realm has completely dissipated, Old Man Yan Shi watches a seven-colored light cocoon crack open and produce a new extreme physique body he names Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique, then names the awakened person Ying Wu Xie.",
      "chapters": [
        1001
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yan-shi-cocoon",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "sys_pure_dream_reality_seeker_physique",
        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A huge ghostly hand stretches out from life and death blessed land toward the ruins of Yi Tian Mountain, with more than half of the arm still inside the door and the entrance opened to its apparent maximum. After stretching out of life and death blessed land, the hand grabs at the mountain ruins and turns large numbers of boulders into powder.",
      "chapters": [
        1010
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ghostly-hand-at-yi-tian",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After grand and myriad tribulations ravage the Yi Tian area, the Gu Immortals who died and the immortal apertures they left behind are refined by the ten extreme formation or destroyed, and only life and death blessed land is intentionally preserved.",
      "chapters": [
        1018
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intentionally-preserved",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even after the battlefield is covered by dream realm, Fang Yuan notes that life and death blessed land is still around among possible remaining apertures.",
      "chapters": [
        1023
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "still-present-under-dream",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan states that the Door of Life and Death is inside Shadow Sect’s blessed land, and that Shadow Sect’s blessed land is at Southern Border’s Yi Tian Mountain, then engulfed by a giant dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        1092
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
